{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/daemon/supervisor_real_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:16:04.784650Z","id":"054f6378cfe0edd2499dc6557caba3f879b15e86aad27f15395d7e59fcd5df72","body":{"detail":"Cleanup is in a finally inside the test body. When the test hits its 3-minute timeout (for example, the restarted Up never arrives), the body is abandoned and the finally never runs, so the started clax keeps running with its home under the system temp directory; daemon.json stays, so its stale watcher never exits it.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":32},"end":{"line":54},"content_hash":"66853d019b4ba365217b2bb97741146a97d204ec3f37660518e6ca5685f9daa2"},"suggested_fix":"Register the cleanup with addTearDown(sup.stop) and addTearDown(() => dir.deleteSync(recursive: true)) right after creating them; tear-downs run after a timeout.","summary":"A timed-out real-binary test leaves its daemon running","tags":["review","daemon","tests","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/daemon/supervisor_real_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:20:33.048914Z","id":"8ac5c3bf55d3f861256c1af908b3baaaeb62fe102fd6d81ec372c9e852574dd7","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Both real-binary tests register sup.stop, the home's deletion (and the stand-in process's kill) with addTearDown, which runs after a timeout. Both pass and no clax-sup-real daemon or sleep is left running (ps checked); CLAX_TEST_BIN=$(tool/test-bin.sh) flutter test test/daemon (apps/clax_app): 31 passed","supersedes":"054f6378cfe0edd2499dc6557caba3f879b15e86aad27f15395d7e59fcd5df72","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
